  "chassis": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - THE BODY BETWEEN THE EARS. 482.6 over the ears; the cover between them reads 293 of 321 px, 440, the body every steel duct of this family shares. The ears, 20.6 each, are not drawn. Height 88.0 is the cover, the same height as the ears on the front view, and the spec table; depth 116.0 the plan and the spec table (116.02)."
