   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - ten fingers a row on the plan, in a three-finger and a seven-finger moulding, the same T-shaped finger as CMH-SFDS1U at the same pitch; 44.0 is taken so that ten fill the 440 body. The fork of each stem is drawn as the stem."
  },
  "front": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - the cover, fitted, as the front view draws it: 440 x 88 with four hinge clips, two on the top edge at 75.0 and 341.8 from the left end and two on the bottom at 119.4 and 297.0, the stagger CMH-SFDS1U carries. The finger rows are 9.0 thick and 4.7 in from the top and bottom, ESTIMATED: the drawing has no side view, and they are taken from the same moulding on CMH-SFDS1U and CMH-DFDS2U."
  },
  "full-depth": {
