   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE VENDOR DRAWING. The FS High Capacity Horizontal Cable Managers datasheet (portal id 7671) draws CMH-SFDS2U as a plan and a front view, dimensioned 482.60, 465.00, 88.03, 76.20 and 116.02. The embedded image is small (543 x 425, carrying a watermark): 0.666 px/mm across the 482.6, 0.668 down the 116.02 and 0.648 down the 88.03, so it is near orthographic but resolves only about 1.5 mm. The straight-on renders of #315743 (front and back) are the second reading."
  },
  "rear": {
